[00:30.66] Kris Kraft
[00:30.82] I miss my trusty Kris Kraft
[00:32.84] That itsy bitsy skiff
[00:35.14] With topsiders and chinos
[00:37.60] Freshly pressed and stiff
[00:39.94] And sometimes when I'm landlocked
[00:42.34] And yearning for the sea
[00:44.60] I get into my bathtub
[00:47.02] Indulge my reverie
[00:50.16] For the quickest silver
[01:31.36] We look so very civilized
[01:36.16] In shocking pink and green
[01:38.44] And what about the beach club
[01:40.76] On Wednesday afternoon
[01:43.10] The ladies clucking lowly
[01:45.38] Like enemy platoons
[01:48.90] One, two, three, go
